# harsh-simplify freeze

Durable decisions from `/harsh-simplify-code` **keep as-is** answers. Survives branch deletion and merge.

When the skill loads, matching findings are **frozen** — no re-ask, no auto-fix.

## When to add a row

After a **keep as-is** (or equivalent) decision during `/harsh-simplify-code`, append a row below in the same change.

## When to remove a row

Delete when the pattern no longer exists, you explicitly chose to refactor it, or the file was removed.

